    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbs of voice",
     "texto": [
      "**Crier** (to shout), **murmurer** (to murmur), **chuchoter** (to whisper), **s'exclamer** (to exclaim) describe the tone: **Il crie que Léa veut partir** (he shouts that Léa wants to leave).",
      "They take **que** and the indicative."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Implorer",
     "texto": [
      "**Implorer** (to beg) asks for something insistently: **J'implore Paul de rester** (I beg Paul to stay). It takes **de** + infinitive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
